          "en": "But that's just a tiny note, just a tiny change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 44.313,
          "en": "to make this homepage at least a little bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.57,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "But that's it for this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "And you did learn a lot about routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 52.98,
          "en": "You learned how you can generally configure routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.98,
          "end": 56.19,
          "en": "and make sure that different components are loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.19,
          "end": 57.513,
          "en": "for different paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.38,
          "end": 60.18,
          "en": "You learned how you can handle errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 63.9,
          "en": "and how you can set up layouts that wrap itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.9,
          "end": 66.09,
          "en": "around multiple routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.09,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "You learned about nested routes, as you can see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 70.8,
          "en": "And most importantly, you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.8,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "about data fetching and submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "You learned how you can generally set up data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 79.71000000000001,
          "en": "and submission with loaders and actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.71000000000001,
          "end": 80.543,
          "en": "And you learned about advanced use cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.543,
          "end": 84.72,
          "en": "where you could use, use fetcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 88.65299999999999,
          "en": "to fetch or load data behind the scenes without navigating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.58,
          "end": 92.85,
          "en": "And you learned about deferring data fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.85,
          "end": 96.78,
          "en": "Which can be helpful if you have some slow requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.78,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "some slow backend, and you wanna show a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "without waiting for the data to be there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "Or if you have multiple pieces of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "and you wanna show some data before all the data is there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.25,
          "en": "as we had it here with the single event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.25,
          "end": 111.87299999999999,
          "en": "and the list of events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "You should not always use the fur",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "but instead use it when you need this behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "when you need to show something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.74,
          "en": "before all the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.74,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "We covered tons of features in this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 127.259,
          "en": "It was a long section for sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.259,
          "end": 128.551,
          "en": "but I hope it's clear ,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.551,
          "end": 131.37,
          "en": "how you can generally configure routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.37,
          "end": 135.019,
          "en": "What the idea behind routing is and how routing works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.019,
          "end": 139.07999999999998,
          "en": "Definitely feel free to go back to individual lectures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.07999999999998,
          "end": 141.93,
          "en": "or to go through this entire section again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.93,
          "end": 144.965,
          "en": "even though it was long but maybe at double speed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.965,
          "end": 147.42000000000002,
          "en": "So that you get all these concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.42000000000002,
          "end": 151.187,
          "en": "down and you fully understand how all these features work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.187,
          "end": 155.7,
          "en": "Because once you start building real React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 158.04,
          "en": "more complex React apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 161.52,
          "en": "You will almost always need routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 165.176,
          "en": "And especially the data fetching and submission capabilities",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.176,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "of React router can make that data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 170.52,
          "en": "and submission part a breeze.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.52,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "You just need to understand how it works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 175.773,
          "en": "and I hope this course section helped you with that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
